(c) hoteles, 4;\n(d) oficinas de gobierno, entre ellas un «Instituto geográfico Agustín\nCodaci», 3; (e) heladerías, yogures y paletas, 3; (f) museos que son el\nmismo museo, 2; (g) bancos y créditos, 2; (h) regalos y antigüedades, 2;\n(i) un bar, Bourbon St., y un servicio de eventos, Borboun St.; (j) un\ncentro comercial llamado Colombian Coffee; (k) una biblioteca que es\nservicio comunitario; (l) un alojamiento del que Overture está seguro al\n12 %; (m) un restaurante llamado Cartagena; (n) otros siete, de uno en\nuno; (ñ) los que siguen abiertos: no se sabe, ninguno dice si opera.\nDe sus 28 edificios, uno tiene nombre («Palacio de la Inquisión») y otro,\nnúmero de pisos: dos.","size":11.0,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":33,"name":"Line","x":14.0,"y":393.0,"w":270.0,"h":0.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Line":{"color":[42,58,82,255],"width":0.5,"dir":"Horizontal","head":"None"}}},{"id":34,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":394.5,"w":270.0,"h":17.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Datos: Overture Maps Foundation, versión 2026-10-21.0: edificios (© colaboradores de OpenStreetMap y Overture, ODbL), lugares (CDLA Permissive 2.0) y\ndirecciones (Overture y sus fuentes), en GeoParquet leído en su sitio. Imágenes: Esri World Imagery (Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics). Contorno de la\nmanzana: trazado con los ejes de calle de Overture. Conteos: DuckDB sobre los mismos archivos. Cita: J. L. Borges, «Del rigor en la ciencia» (1946).\nCómo se hizo: todo en RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app): los tres GeoParquet de Overture, agregados a mano por su dirección (Home › Add › From URL) y\nleídos por rangos, y cuatro scripts: filtro por id, color y etiquetas por expresión, y layouts.\nScripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":6.0,"color":[138,151,171,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":35,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":412.0,"w":270.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"#30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Día 14: Borgesian map · Hecho con RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":7.0,"color":[95,168,232,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":36},{"name":"Day 14","width":297.0,"height":420.0,"elements":[{"id":2,"name":"Rectangle","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"w":297.0,"h":420.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[20,32,43,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.0}}},{"id":1,"name":"Map Frame","x":10.0,"y":44.0,"w":277.0,"h":250.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Manzana","center":{"x":-75.551632,"y":10.423617},"scale":700.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":null}}},{"id":3,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":8.0,"w":270.0,"h":5.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"30DAYMAPCHALLENGE · DAY 14 · BORGESIAN MAP · CARTAGENA","size":9.0,"color":[95,168,232,255],"bold":false,"letter_spacing":2.5}}},{"id":4,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":14.0,"w":270.0,"h":16.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"On Exactitude in a Block","size":34.0,"color":[255,255,255,255],"bold":true}}},{"id":5,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":31.5,"w":270.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Everything Overture knows about the block of the Palace of the Inquisition, in Cartagena's historic centre","size":11.0,"color":[184,196,214,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":6,"name":"Text","x":192.0,"y":214.0,"w":34.0,"h":10.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Plaza de\nBolívar","size":10.0,"color":[184,196,214,255],"bold":false,"italic":true,"align":"Center"}}},{"id":7,"name":"Rectangle","x":14.0,"y":270.0,"w":92.0,"h":20.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[20,32,43,255],"outline":[95,168,232,255],"width":0.6,"radius":1.5}}},{"id":8,"name":"North Arrow","x":18.0,"y":273.0,"w":5.0,"h":14.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"NorthArrow":{"frame":1,"style":"Triangle","fill":[255,255,255,255],"outline":[255,255,255,255]}}},{"id":9,"name":"Scale Bar","x":27.0,"y":275.0,"w":34.0,"h":8.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"ScaleBar":{"frame":1,"units":"Meters","divisions":2,"style":"Line","color":[255,255,255,255],"fill":[255,255,255,255]}}},{"id":10,"name":"Text","x":65.0,"y":274.0,"w":40.0,"h":10.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"1:700\nnot yet 1:1","size":8.0,"color":[255,210,63,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":11,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":301.0,"w":120.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"THE MAP THE SIZE OF THE EMPIRE","size":8.0,"color":[95,168,232,255],"bold":true,"letter_spacing":2.0}}},{"id":12,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":307.0,"w":125.0,"h":18.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"«…levantaron un Mapa del Imperio, que tenía\nel tamaño del Imperio y coincidía\npuntualmente con él.»","size":11.0,"color":[255,255,255,255],"bold":false,"italic":true}}},{"id":13,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":326.0,"w":125.0,"h":12.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Jorge Luis Borges, «Del rigor en la ciencia», 1946:\n\"they drew up a Map of the Empire that was the size\nof the Empire and matched it exactly\"","size":7.0,"color":[143,179,217,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":14,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":343.0,"w":120.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"THE 45 PLACES, BY GROUP","size":8.0,"color":[95,168,232,255],"bold":true,"letter_spacing":2.0}}},{"id":15,"name":"Circle","x":15.0,"y":349.0,"w":4.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Ellipse":{"fill":[228,87,46,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.4}}},{"id":16,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":348.6,"w":80.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Eating and drinking · 14","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":17,"name":"Circle","x":15.0,"y":355.5,"w":4.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Ellipse":{"fill":[255,210,63,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.4}}},{"id":18,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":355.1,"w":80.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Shopping · 13","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":19,"name":"Circle","x":15.0,"y":362.0,"w":4.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Ellipse":{"fill":[123,211,137,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.4}}},{"id":20,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":361.6,"w":80.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Institutions · 8","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":21,"name":"Circle","x":15.0,"y":368.5,"w":4.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Ellipse":{"fill":[95,168,232,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.4}}},{"id":22,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":368.1,"w":80.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Sleeping · 5","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":23,"name":"Circle","x":15.0,"y":375.0,"w":4.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Ellipse":{"fill":[201,184,240,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.4}}},{"id":24,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":374.6,"w":80.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Services and others · 5","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":25,"name":"Rectangle","x":15.5,"y":382.3,"w":3.0,"h":3.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,255],"outline":[20,32,43,255],"width":0.3}}},{"id":26,"name":"Text","x":22.0,"y":381.6,"w":40.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Address · 21","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":27,"name":"Rectangle","x":66.0,"y":381.8,"w":5.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,0],"outline":[255,255,255,255],"width":0.6}}},{"id":28,"name":"Text","x":74.0,"y":381.6,"w":40.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Building · 28","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":29,"name":"Rectangle","x":110.0,"y":381.8,"w":5.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,0],"outline":[255,210,63,255],"width":0.9}}},{"id":30,"name":"Text","x":118.0,"y":381.6,"w":30.0,"h":4.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Block","size":8.5,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":31,"name":"Text","x":150.0,"y":301.0,"w":137.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"THE INVENTORY, AFTER BORGES","size":8.0,"color":[95,168,232,255],"bold":true,"letter_spacing":2.0}}},{"id":32,"name":"Text","x":150.0,"y":307.0,"w":137.0,"h":80.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"According to Overture, the 45 places in the block are divided into\n(a) restaurants, 9; (b) clothing and jewellery shops, 8; (c) hotels, 4;\n(d) government offices, among them an \"Instituto geográfico Agustín\nCodaci\", 3; (e) ice cream, yoghurt and ice lolly shops, 3; (f) museums\nthat are the same museum, 2; (g) banks and lenders, 2; (h) gifts and\nantiques, 2; (i) a bar, Bourbon St., and an events service, Borboun St.;\n(j) a shopping centre called Colombian Coffee; (k) a library listed as a\ncommunity service; (l) a lodging Overture is 12% sure of; (m) a\nrestaurant called Cartagena; (n) seven more, one of each; (ñ) those still\nopen: unknown, none says whether it operates.\nOf its 28 buildings, one has a name (\"Palacio de la Inquisión\") and\nanother, a number of floors: two.","size":11.0,"color":[230,236,245,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":33,"name":"Line","x":14.0,"y":393.0,"w":270.0,"h":0.5,"visible":true,"kind":{"Line":{"color":[42,58,82,255],"width":0.5,"dir":"Horizontal","head":"None"}}},{"id":34,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":394.5,"w":270.0,"h":17.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Data: Overture Maps Foundation, release 2026-10-21.0: buildings (© OpenStreetMap contributors and Overture, ODbL), places (CDLA Permissive 2.0) and\naddresses (Overture and its sources), as GeoParquet read in place. Imagery: Esri World Imagery (Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics). Block outline:\ndrawn from Overture's street centre lines. Counts: DuckDB on the same files. Quote: J. L. Borges, \"Del rigor en la ciencia\" (1946), our translation.\nHow it was made: all in RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app): the three Overture GeoParquet files, added by hand from their address (Home › Add › From URL) and\nread by range, and four scripts: filter by id, colour and labels by expression, and layouts.\nScripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":6.0,"color":[138,151,171,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":35,"name":"Text","x":14.0,"y":412.0,"w":270.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"#30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Day 14: Borgesian map · Made with RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":7.0,"color":[95,168,232,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":36}],"folders":[],"styles":[],"ramps":[],"tasks":[],"gp_env":{"extent":null,"cell_size":null},"models":[],"workspaces":[],"link_views":false,"jobs":[],"offline_areas":[],"reports":[],"presentations":[],"notebooks":[],"dl_models":[],"shared":[],"data_stores":[]}